 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Night of the Haunted Live Stream"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "心霊配信の夜 〜見たら死ぬホームページの謎を暴け！〜"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "I heard there's a webpage that kills you if you look at it...\" To uncover the truth behind this rumor, horror streamers Ina and Isuke—nicknamed the \"Easters\"—head to the house where the incident allegedly occurred and start a live broadcast. They try to access the cursed webpage in the room of the person believed to be its creator, but inexplicable supernatural phenomena begin to occur one after another. Eventually, a terrifying curse descends upon Ina and the others, dragging viewers into the chaos as the situation spirals into the worst possible outcome. Will the Easters manage to expose the horrifying truth?"
  },
